# M4.29.2 root Git ownership preflight

Date: 2026-08-28

## Symptom

The literal remote transaction stopped during its first Control HEAD check with
Git's `detected dubious ownership` protection.

## Cause

The administrative transaction runs as root, while the canonical Control
checkout is owned and intentionally operated by `chatops`. Root Git therefore
refused the checkout before the unit-install step.

## Impact

The staged unit was not installed and Agentmode was not started. The fail-closed
trap issued idempotent stops for the three already-stopped maintenance units.
Control and the Adult Candidate were unchanged.

## Resolution

Run every read-only Control Git query under the owning `chatops` identity with
`runuser`. Do not add a global or system `safe.directory` exception. Keep
privileged install and systemd operations under root and retain the same
fail-closed stop behavior.
